"""Public policy/terms/deletion pages, enabled only with real operator details."""
import html,json
from pathlib import Path
from online_safety import TERMS_TEXT

def page(path,config_path):
    try:
        d=json.loads(Path(config_path).read_text())
        if not all(isinstance(d.get(k),str) and d[k].strip() for k in ('developer_name','support_email','effective_date','legal_basis','provider_practices','children_practices','international_transfers')):raise ValueError()
        if '@' not in d['support_email']:raise ValueError()
    except (OSError,ValueError,TypeError):return 503,b'Public policy configuration is pending.'
    e=lambda k:html.escape(d[k]);contact='<a href="mailto:'+e('support_email')+'">'+e('support_email')+'</a>'
    if path=='/terms':title='Scorer community rules';body='<p>'+html.escape(TERMS_TEXT)+'</p>'
    elif path=='/delete':
        title='Scorer public record removal';body='<p>In the game open Leaderboard and choose Stop sharing &amp; remove. Keep the app installed until removal completes. You can remove records even when public access is locked.</p><p>If you lost the app or cannot remove a record, contact '+contact+' with the public player/team/season and division. Do not send passwords, adult PINs or administrator/ownership tokens. We assess ownership without disclosing another person’s records. The game has no email/password account. Uninstalling does not itself delete public records.</p>'
    else:
        title='Scorer and Scorer World privacy policy'
        body='''<p>Effective: %s. Responsible developer: %s. Privacy and support contact: %s.</p>
<p>Scorer and Scorer World have independent on-device careers. There are no adverts, advertising SDKs or in-app purchases. Both apps are free.</p>
<h2>Automatic aggregate usage</h2><p>After the in-app notice is acknowledged, the game automatically sends nine numeric counters: app openings, normal closes, new/loaded careers, completed training/matches, goals and save/load failures. Recipient: stats.clemir.com. Purpose: understand game usage. There is no in-game usage switch. No name, career, free text, exact event time or device/session identifier is in this payload. These are events, not unique users. Local unsent counts expire after seven days; combined daily totals are retained for 90 days. Counts can arrive late or be duplicated after an uncertain network acknowledgement.</p>
<h2>Optional public season records</h2><p>Adult-managed access and acceptance of community rules precede sharing. Only explicit Share publishes chosen name, team, finished season, matches, goals, edition/country/division. Use a nickname; no personal contacts or school details. A private random ownership token authorizes uploads/removal; its server hash is not a login password. Public opaque publisher/record IDs support blocking and reports. Submissions await moderator approval; scores are self-reported. Records stay until removal or moderation. Stop sharing &amp; remove erases records; offline requests wait for a connection. Losing app data may prevent automatic proof of ownership: use the contact above for help.</p>
<h2>Safety and local files</h2><p>Adult PINs are salted hashes stored locally. A date entered during adult setup is checked locally and is not stored or sent; this is self-declared adult action, not verified identity. Safety preferences and blocked publisher IDs remain local. Reports transmit the reporter token, targeted public publisher ID and a fixed reason, retained for up to 30 days. Suspensions retain the public publisher ID until lifted to prevent re-publication. Birth dates, PINs and careers are not uploaded. Career exports contain names and game progress; only export to a trusted document destination. Exports exclude adult controls, statistics and ownership tokens. Free/World cannot import each other's careers. Uninstall removes private files, not exported documents or public records.</p>
<h2>Transport and processors</h2><p>HTTPS validates certificates. Cloudflare Tunnel/CDN processes network connection information, including IP addresses, to carry and secure requests. The laptop collector does not log IP addresses, user agents or raw requests. Provider practices: %s. No automatic email service is active.</p>
<h2>Retention, deletion and rights</h2><p>Public record backups are excluded from the managed backup process; aggregate-only backups expire after seven days. Local exported files remain wherever the player saved them. Requests for access, correction, removal, objection and other applicable data rights can be sent to the privacy contact. Aggregated counts cannot be separated back into individual contributions. Public record sharing is optional; disabling adult-managed access stops sharing and queues removal. Legal basis for automatic collection: %s. The app includes minors: %s. Cross-border processing and safeguards: %s.</p>'''%(e('effective_date'),e('developer_name'),contact,html.escape(d.get('provider_practices','Operator review pending')),e('legal_basis'),html.escape(d.get('children_practices','Operator review pending')),html.escape(d.get('international_transfers','Operator review pending')))
    doc='<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>'+title+'</title><style>body{font:18px system-ui;max-width:860px;margin:32px auto;padding:16px;line-height:1.6}a{color:#056}</style><h1>'+title+'</h1>'+body+'<p>Contact: '+contact+'</p><nav><a href="/privacy">Privacy policy</a> · <a href="/terms">Community rules</a> · <a href="/delete">Remove records</a></nav></html>'
    return 200,doc.encode('utf8')
